{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H14", `type`: "Report", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H14", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H14", `name`: "H14", `published_on`: "2026-10-14", `first_supported_available_on`: "2026-10-14", `collected_on`: "2026-10-16", `available_on`: "2026-10-14", `source_type`: "COMPANY", `source_id`: "company:O1", `body_status`: "COMPLETE", `confirmation_scope`: ["NovaChips' signed completion notice confirms that its acquisition of DragonLogic's Kestrel AI-chip design business closed on 14 October 2026 after receipt of the required customer consent; payment of 240 million credits and transfer of the specified assets and employees occurred that day."], `confirmation_scope_basis`: "SUPPLIED_INPUT; not independently verified", `input_file`: "evidence/input.json", `input_path`: "$.reports[13]", `original_url`: null, `original_url_status`: "FICTIONAL_NO_URL"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H14", `type`: "ProcessingRecord", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H14", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H14", `name`: "H14 processing", `processing_status`: "COMPLETE", `cap_omitted`: false, `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `output_path`: "$.reports[13]", `retained_idea_count`: 1}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H14.p1", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H14.p1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H14.p1", `name`: "H14.p1", `position`: 1, `text`: "NovaChips completed its acquisition of DragonLogic's Kestrel AI-chip design business today, 14 October, after receiving the customer consent required by the purchase agreement. The 240 million credit payment has been made and ownership of the specified design files and patents has transferred. The engineering team covered by the agreement has joined NovaChips and will retain its existing office during the integration period.", `text_sha256`: "204317343843a122de7b2c8a4559344d4d14274602799ccd0b32e178262a7e32", `input_path`: "$.reports[13].paragraphs[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H14.p2", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H14.p2", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H14.p2", `name`: "H14.p2", `position`: 2, `text`: "The transaction was announced on 1 October with a target closing date of today. That announcement remained subject to the customer's consent, which arrived yesterday. Our completion notice records the transfer taking effect this morning. DragonLogic's remaining chip programmes are outside the transaction, and the companies have retained the previously described licensing arrangement for ongoing Kestrel customer projects.", `text_sha256`: "731d36dca2e4a4a92d30b61d1c714adb8d82ebd19bab1602dbcf4968ed5952b7", `input_path`: "$.reports[13].paragraphs[1]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H14.p3", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H14.p3", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H14.p3", `name`: "H14.p3", `position`: 3, `text`: "Customers should continue using the same support addresses while the design records are moved into NovaChips' engineering systems. Existing Kestrel product names will remain in documentation so that customers can identify compatible designs. The integration schedule is being managed by the transferred engineering team; future product release dates will be communicated through the usual product notices.", `text_sha256`: "f7be447c003ff15c513296f459ac0fa77b5560cfb9b3fac8df39576186bf8add", `input_path`: "$.reports[13].paragraphs[2]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H14.1", `type`: "Expression", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H14.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H14.1", `report_id`: "H14", `position`: 1, `kind`: "FACT", `event_phase`: "OCCURRED", `output_path`: "$.reports[13].ideas[0]", `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `judgment_status`: "NO_RETAINED_UP_DOWN"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H14.1", `type`: "Idea", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H14.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H14.1", `summary`: "NovaChips completed its acquisition of DragonLogic's Kestrel AI-chip design business on 14 October 2026 after obtaining the required customer consent. The 240 million credit payment, transfer of specified design files and patents, and transfer of the engineering team occurred.", `identity_scope`: "REPORT_LOCAL_SINGLETON", `output_path`: "$.reports[13].ideas[0]", `domain_state`: "EXTRACTED"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H14.1.e1", `type`: "Passage", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H14.1.e1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H14.1 evidence 1", `quote`: "NovaChips completed its acquisition of DragonLogic's Kestrel AI-chip design business today, 14 October, after receiving the customer consent required by the purchase agreement. The 240 million credit payment has been made and ownership of the specified design files and patents has transferred. The engineering team covered by the agreement has joined NovaChips and will retain its existing office during the integration period.", `paragraph_id`: "H14.p1", `position`: 1, `start_codepoint`: 0, `end_codepoint`: 428, `start_utf8_byte`: 0, `end_utf8_byte`: 428, `offset_convention`: "ZERO_BASED_END_EXCLUSIVE", `output_path`: "$.reports[13].ideas[0].evidence[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Source/outlet:cloud-register", `type`: "Source", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Source/outlet:cloud-register", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `source_id`: "outlet:cloud-register", `name`: "outlet:cloud-register", `source_type`: "OUTLET", `origin`: "SUPPLIED_FIXTURE_SOURCE_ID"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H15", `type`: "Report", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H15", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H15", `name`: "H15", `published_on`: "2026-10-08", `first_supported_available_on`: "2026-10-09", `collected_on`: "2026-10-15", `available_on`: "2026-10-09", `source_type`: "OUTLET", `source_id`: "outlet:cloud-register", `body_status`: "COMPLETE", `confirmation_scope`: ["NovaCloud's signed amended quarterly operating statement confirms a 9% reduction in its own cloud-software hosting cost per active tenant in the completed third quarter relative to the preceding quarter. It withdraws the 19% figure printed in the first version because that calculation omitted an August invoice."], `confirmation_scope_basis`: "SUPPLIED_INPUT; not independently verified", `input_file`: "evidence/input.json", `input_path`: "$.reports[14]", `original_url`: null, `original_url_status`: "FICTIONAL_NO_URL"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H15", `type`: "ProcessingRecord", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H15", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H15", `name`: "H15 processing", `processing_status`: "COMPLETE", `cap_omitted`: false, `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `output_path`: "$.reports[14]", `retained_idea_count`: 1}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H15.p1", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H15.p1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H15.p1", `name`: "H15.p1", `position`: 1, `text`: "NovaCloud cut hosting cost per active tenant by 9% in the completed third quarter, according to an amended operating statement circulated to customers on Friday. The cloud-software provider withdrew the 19% reduction printed in the first version of the statement. An August infrastructure invoice had been omitted from that calculation, and the corrected comparison uses the same tenant count and preceding-quarter baseline.", `text_sha256`: "8ebc8fae1351b0e4aecaeb9105bd4b80778b46f34216115b67da4a19ab72aac1", `input_path`: "$.reports[14].paragraphs[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H15.p2", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H15.p2", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H15.p2", `name`: "H15.p2", `position`: 2, `text`: "The adjustment leaves NovaCloud with a smaller cost improvement than the first statement suggested. Its finance note attributes the remaining reduction to denser scheduling of customer workloads and fewer idle overnight instances. The amended table replaces the earlier cost line throughout the document. Customer subscription prices and the company's method for counting active tenants were unchanged during the reporting period.", `text_sha256`: "c16396c8b4f5a800e66d3558e6cf7e955871c440cd248b531a19eaf653d62542", `input_path`: "$.reports[14].paragraphs[1]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H15.p3", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H15.p3", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H15.p3", `name`: "H15.p3", `position`: 3, `text`: "NovaCloud is owned by NovaChips, whose chip business is discussed in a separate report. This statement covers the subsidiary's cloud-software operations. The original document remains in the archive with a correction banner, while the revised copy carries the finance director's signature. Customers that downloaded the first version were sent the revised table alongside an explanation of the missing invoice.", `text_sha256`: "8a8529810a5daa57ba475feabd23d130d59c932b8cb087f30c54ea76890c8787", `input_path`: "$.reports[14].paragraphs[2]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H15.1", `type`: "Expression", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H15.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H15.1", `report_id`: "H15", `position`: 1, `kind`: "CONFIRMED_NEWS", `event_phase`: "OCCURRED", `output_path`: "$.reports[14].ideas[0]", `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `judgment_status`: "NO_RETAINED_UP_DOWN"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H15.1", `type`: "Idea", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H15.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H15.1", `summary`: "NovaCloud corrected its completed third-quarter cloud-software hosting cost reduction per active tenant to 9% against the preceding quarter, withdrawing the earlier 19% figure because an August invoice had been omitted.", `identity_scope`: "REPORT_LOCAL_SINGLETON", `output_path`: "$.reports[14].ideas[0]", `domain_state`: "EXTRACTED"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H15.1.e1", `type`: "Passage", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H15.1.e1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H15.1 evidence 1", `quote`: "NovaCloud cut hosting cost per active tenant by 9% in the completed third quarter, according to an amended operating statement circulated to customers on Friday. The cloud-software provider withdrew the 19% reduction printed in the first version of the statement. An August infrastructure invoice had been omitted from that calculation, and the corrected comparison uses the same tenant count and preceding-quarter baseline.", `paragraph_id`: "H15.p1", `position`: 1, `start_codepoint`: 0, `end_codepoint`: 424, `start_utf8_byte`: 0, `end_utf8_byte`: 424, `offset_convention`: "ZERO_BASED_END_EXCLUSIVE", `output_path`: "$.reports[14].ideas[0].evidence[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H16", `type`: "Report", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H16", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H16", `name`: "H16", `published_on`: "2026-10-10", `first_supported_available_on`: "2026-10-10", `collected_on`: "2026-10-15", `available_on`: "2026-10-10", `source_type`: "COMPANY", `source_id`: "company:O4", `body_status`: "COMPLETE", `confirmation_scope`: ["ForgeFoundry's signed operating notice confirms that its F8 wafer-fabrication line entered commercial operation on 10 October 2026, processed its first paid production batch that day, and has an installed capacity of 6,000 wafers per month. The capacity is not a statement of realised monthly output."], `confirmation_scope_basis`: "SUPPLIED_INPUT; not independently verified", `input_file`: "evidence/input.json", `input_path`: "$.reports[15]", `original_url`: null, `original_url_status`: "FICTIONAL_NO_URL"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H16", `type`: "ProcessingRecord", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H16", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H16", `name`: "H16 processing", `processing_status`: "COMPLETE", `cap_omitted`: false, `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `output_path`: "$.reports[15]", `retained_idea_count`: 1}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H16.p1", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H16.p1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H16.p1", `name`: "H16.p1", `position`: 1, `text`: "ForgeFoundry's F8 wafer-fabrication line entered commercial operation this morning and processed its first paid production batch. The line has an installed capacity of 6,000 wafers per month. Initial operations use one shift while technicians complete the handover from the installation team. Monthly output will depend on the mix of customer processes and the pace at which additional shifts are introduced.", `text_sha256`: "e7b95d2b016774216fdbb35c82f1a139c6f282f2e31e86bbee9b9c4a7908ac15", `input_path`: "$.reports[15].paragraphs[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H16.p2", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H16.p2", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H16.p2", `name`: "H16.p2", `position`: 2, `text`: "The first batch uses the same fabrication sequence that passed the line's acceptance tests last month. Those earlier tests were engineering runs; today's batch was entered into the customer production ledger and billed under an existing manufacturing order. The operating notice marks the line's transfer from the construction programme to the fab's production manager, with routine maintenance now handled by the operations team.", `text_sha256`: "51c8a549f4c22c1c1a4a9be2881cc2e8abb15b2d18984d02266d8af491714b1d", `input_path`: "$.reports[15].paragraphs[1]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H16.p3", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H16.p3", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H16.p3", `name`: "H16.p3", `position`: 3, `text`: "NovaChips is among the customers whose AI-chip designs can be manufactured on F8. Ridge Materials supplies chemicals used elsewhere at the site. Neither customer's future order volume nor the supplier's shipments form part of today's operating notice. The facility will use its existing dispatch area, and completed wafers will follow the fab's normal inspection route before shipment.", `text_sha256`: "658efb44f792cee1226913ad6732ee16d88265cfb75cfd8955d5cc5ade6fa3ee", `input_path`: "$.reports[15].paragraphs[2]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H16.1", `type`: "Expression", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H16.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H16.1", `report_id`: "H16", `position`: 1, `kind`: "FACT", `event_phase`: "OCCURRED", `output_path`: "$.reports[15].ideas[0]", `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `judgment_status`: "NO_RETAINED_UP_DOWN"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H16.1", `type`: "Idea", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H16.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H16.1", `summary`: "ForgeFoundry's F8 wafer-fabrication line entered commercial operation and processed its first paid production batch on 10 October 2026. Its installed capacity is 6,000 wafers per month, which does not establish realised monthly output.", `identity_scope`: "REPORT_LOCAL_SINGLETON", `output_path`: "$.reports[15].ideas[0]", `domain_state`: "EXTRACTED"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H16.1.e1", `type`: "Passage", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H16.1.e1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H16.1 evidence 1", `quote`: "ForgeFoundry's F8 wafer-fabrication line entered commercial operation this morning and processed its first paid production batch. The line has an installed capacity of 6,000 wafers per month.", `paragraph_id`: "H16.p1", `position`: 1, `start_codepoint`: 0, `end_codepoint`: 191, `start_utf8_byte`: 0, `end_utf8_byte`: 191, `offset_convention`: "ZERO_BASED_END_EXCLUSIVE", `output_path`: "$.reports[15].ideas[0].evidence[0]"}},
