{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H24.p1", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H24.p1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H24.p1", `name`: "H24.p1", `position`: 1, `text`: "NovaCloud announced plans to open a limited customer trial of Harbor, its cloud-software budgeting service, on 2 November. The product bulletin invites existing customers to register their interest and says invitations will be sent after the trial environment passes its final checks. Harbor is not yet available to customers. The planned trial will initially cover a small group of accounts before NovaCloud decides whether to offer a wider release.", `text_sha256`: "bc3e992dac75e2acdbbc907a07c0693afbcfcb6ddb7dc471402941a4f4dc9e85", `input_path`: "$.reports[23].paragraphs[0]"}},
