{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Person/person:celine", `type`: "Person", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Person/person:celine", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `source_id`: "person:celine", `name`: "person:celine", `identity_scope`: "SOURCE_ID_ONLY; real-world identity not established"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H25", `type`: "Report", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H25", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H25", `name`: "H25", `published_on`: "2026-11-03", `first_supported_available_on`: "2026-11-04", `collected_on`: "2027-01-12", `available_on`: "2026-11-04", `source_type`: "PERSON", `source_id`: "person:celine", `body_status`: "COMPLETE", `confirmation_scope`: [], `confirmation_scope_basis`: "SUPPLIED_INPUT; not independently verified", `input_file`: "evidence/input.json", `input_path`: "$.reports[24]", `original_url`: null, `original_url_status`: "FICTIONAL_NO_URL"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H25", `type`: "ProcessingRecord", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H25", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H25", `name`: "H25 processing", `processing_status`: "COMPLETE", `cap_omitted`: false, `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `output_path`: "$.reports[24]", `retained_idea_count`: 1}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H25.p1", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H25.p1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H25.p1", `name`: "H25.p1", `position`: 1, `text`: "Le retour de la hausse ?", `text_sha256`: "f37503b0090c94fa091c9953ff3179ac96db677c2062f73f42ac8c4d04f711fc", `input_path`: "$.reports[24].paragraphs[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H25.p2", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H25.p2", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H25.p2", `name`: "H25.p2", `position`: 2, `text`: "Je reviens sur NovaChips après avoir relu mon carnet consacré à sa puce d’IA N7. Mon premier brouillon insistait sur la file de clients du salon et sur la qualité de la démonstration. Cette impression explique le titre resté dans la version imprimée, mais elle ne correspond plus à mon scénario central. Les démonstrations ne suffisent pas à lever mon doute sur le calendrier des premières livraisons. La différence entre une réservation et une réception effective reste le point décisif de mon raisonnement.", `text_sha256`: "559f92a2ed4bfa8d59e06576ed58e8941c2c116af937fd1a633e6e2841184fe3", `input_path`: "$.reports[24].paragraphs[1]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H25.p3", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H25.p3", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H25.p3", `name`: "H25.p3", `position`: 3, `text`: "Si les premières livraisons restent bloquées, je prévois une baisse de son action pendant les deux prochaines semaines. Ce scénario reste conditionnel : une reprise des expéditions ferait tomber cette objection. Je ne traite donc pas la foule du salon comme une garantie de demande durable. Mon attention porte sur la possibilité pour les clients de recevoir une puce utilisable, puis de renouveler leurs commandes. La prudence de cette lecture tient au décalage entre une démonstration convaincante et un produit effectivement livré. Voilà pourquoi le point d’interrogation du titre doit être pris au sérieux.", `text_sha256`: "373ac450eedef99655c82197c8af94ec9ba39b36a5ec5f1f8719c90e0cad4f49", `input_path`: "$.reports[24].paragraphs[2]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H25.1", `type`: "Expression", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H25.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H25.1", `report_id`: "H25", `position`: 1, `kind`: "OPINION", `event_phase`: "NONE", `output_path`: "$.reports[24].ideas[0]", `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `judgment_status`: "HAS_RETAINED_UP_DOWN"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H25.1", `type`: "Idea", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H25.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H25.1", `summary`: "The author forecasts a fall in NovaChips shares over the next two weeks if initial N7 AI-chip deliveries remain blocked; resumed shipments would remove this objection.", `identity_scope`: "REPORT_LOCAL_SINGLETON", `output_path`: "$.reports[24].ideas[0]", `domain_state`: "EXTRACTED"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Judgment/H25.1.j1", `type`: "Judgment", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Judgment/H25.1.j1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "NOVA DOWN", `stock`: "NOVA", `direction`: "DOWN", `window_state`: "RELATIVE", `start`: "2026-11-03", `end`: "2026-11-17", `position`: 1, `output_path`: "$.reports[24].ideas[0].judgments[0]", `qualification_location`: "PARENT_IDEA_SUMMARY_AND_EVIDENCE", `end_boundary`: "EXCLUSIVE_TRIAL_CONVENTION"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H25.1.e1", `type`: "Passage", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H25.1.e1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H25.1 evidence 1", `quote`: "Je reviens sur NovaChips après avoir relu mon carnet consacré à sa puce d’IA N7.", `paragraph_id`: "H25.p2", `position`: 1, `start_codepoint`: 0, `end_codepoint`: 80, `start_utf8_byte`: 0, `end_utf8_byte`: 85, `offset_convention`: "ZERO_BASED_END_EXCLUSIVE", `output_path`: "$.reports[24].ideas[0].evidence[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H25.1.e2", `type`: "Passage", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H25.1.e2", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H25.1 evidence 2", `quote`: "Si les premières livraisons restent bloquées, je prévois une baisse de son action pendant les deux prochaines semaines. Ce scénario reste conditionnel : une reprise des expéditions ferait tomber cette objection.", `paragraph_id`: "H25.p3", `position`: 2, `start_codepoint`: 0, `end_codepoint`: 211, `start_utf8_byte`: 0, `end_utf8_byte`: 216, `offset_convention`: "ZERO_BASED_END_EXCLUSIVE", `output_path`: "$.reports[24].ideas[0].evidence[1]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Source/company:O3", `type`: "Source", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Source/company:O3", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `source_id`: "company:O3", `name`: "company:O3", `source_type`: "COMPANY", `origin`: "SUPPLIED_FIXTURE_SOURCE_ID"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H26", `type`: "Report", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H26", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H26", `name`: "H26", `published_on`: "2026-11-05", `first_supported_available_on`: "2026-11-05", `collected_on`: "2027-01-12", `available_on`: "2026-11-05", `source_type`: "COMPANY", `source_id`: "company:O3", `body_status`: "COMPLETE", `confirmation_scope`: ["NovaCloud third-quarter cloud-software hosting-cost reduction of 12%, including the stated accounting scope and completed cost actions"], `confirmation_scope_basis`: "SUPPLIED_INPUT; not independently verified", `input_file`: "evidence/input.json", `input_path`: "$.reports[25]", `original_url`: null, `original_url_status`: "FICTIONAL_NO_URL"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H26", `type`: "ProcessingRecord", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H26", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H26", `name`: "H26 processing", `processing_status`: "COMPLETE", `cap_omitted`: false, `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `output_path`: "$.reports[25]", `retained_idea_count`: 1}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H26.p1", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H26.p1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H26.p1", `name`: "H26.p1", `position`: 1, `text`: "NovaCloud十一月成本简报｜本期回顾已经结束的第三季度。作为NovaChips旗下的云软件公司，我们把各区域的托管账单放在同一口径下复核；集团名称出现在封面和页脚，表格中的费用则属于NovaCloud自身。旧版图表曾将预付款与当期消耗混列，本期已经改按实际使用月份排列。读者因此可以直接比较相邻两个季度，而不必把付款日期当成服务发生日期。", `text_sha256`: "5d6a9837293e9f3d6f429fac80e88f7ef02158ccd1f743f29451810c2f97ff02", `input_path`: "$.reports[25].paragraphs[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H26.p2", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H26.p2", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H26.p2", `name`: "H26.p2", `position`: 2, `text`: "经签署的季度费用表显示，NovaCloud的云软件托管成本较上一季度下降１２％。减少的费用来自已停用的闲置实例和重新排定的夜间任务；统计范围包含相同的服务区域，未把新增客户的收入抵扣成本。费用表在本期简报发布时一并开放下载，正文中的百分比与表末合计相符。", `text_sha256`: "4f61ad86855461b806cc4482d7a523682d673a85439d6fe1765f45e9bb6cc3a0", `input_path`: "$.reports[25].paragraphs[1]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H26.p3", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H26.p3", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H26.p3", `name`: "H26.p3", `position`: 3, `text`: "经签署的季度费用表显示，NovaCloud的云软件托管成本较上一季度下降１２％。减少的费用来自已停用的闲置实例和重新排定的夜间任务；统计范围包含相同的服务区域，未把新增客户的收入抵扣成本。费用表在本期简报发布时一并开放下载，正文中的百分比与表末合计相符。", `text_sha256`: "4f61ad86855461b806cc4482d7a523682d673a85439d6fe1765f45e9bb6cc3a0", `input_path`: "$.reports[25].paragraphs[2]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H26.p4", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H26.p4", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H26.p4", `name`: "H26.p4", `position`: 4, `text`: "页面存档保留了桌面版和窄屏版共有的一段文字，因此下载文件中出现两次同样的成本说明。财务附表仍只有一份，列示的都是本公司已经支付或确认的托管服务费用。集团的芯片业务没有进入这张表的范围。", `text_sha256`: "2410463f4165bd34e8278a42b683899ea23c2d300a73764fcedf9c4fbb3d64d1", `input_path`: "$.reports[25].paragraphs[3]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H26.1", `type`: "Expression", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H26.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H26.1", `report_id`: "H26", `position`: 1, `kind`: "FACT", `event_phase`: "OCCURRED", `output_path`: "$.reports[25].ideas[0]", `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `judgment_status`: "NO_RETAINED_UP_DOWN"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H26.1", `type`: "Idea", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H26.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H26.1", `summary`: "NovaCloud confirms that its completed third-quarter cloud-software hosting costs fell 12% versus the preceding quarter, covering the same service regions without offsetting new-customer revenue. The reductions came from deactivated idle instances and rescheduled nighttime tasks.", `identity_scope`: "REPORT_LOCAL_SINGLETON", `output_path`: "$.reports[25].ideas[0]", `domain_state`: "EXTRACTED"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H26.1.e1", `type`: "Passage", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H26.1.e1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H26.1 evidence 1", `quote`: "经签署的季度费用表显示，NovaCloud的云软件托管成本较上一季度下降１２％。减少的费用来自已停用的闲置实例和重新排定的夜间任务；统计范围包含相同的服务区域，未把新增客户的收入抵扣成本。", `paragraph_id`: "H26.p2", `position`: 1, `start_codepoint`: 0, `end_codepoint`: 94, `start_utf8_byte`: 0, `end_utf8_byte`: 264, `offset_convention`: "ZERO_BASED_END_EXCLUSIVE", `output_path`: "$.reports[25].ideas[0].evidence[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Source/outlet:atelier", `type`: "Source", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Source/outlet:atelier", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `source_id`: "outlet:atelier", `name`: "outlet:atelier", `source_type`: "OUTLET", `origin`: "SUPPLIED_FIXTURE_SOURCE_ID"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H27", `type`: "Report", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Report/H27", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H27", `name`: "H27", `published_on`: "2026-11-06", `first_supported_available_on`: "2026-11-06", `collected_on`: "2027-01-12", `available_on`: "2026-11-06", `source_type`: "OUTLET", `source_id`: "outlet:atelier", `body_status`: "COMPLETE", `confirmation_scope`: ["Official announcement of the N8 AI-chip production plan and its stated planned 12 December start; not future execution"], `confirmation_scope_basis`: "SUPPLIED_INPUT; not independently verified", `input_file`: "evidence/input.json", `input_path`: "$.reports[26]", `original_url`: null, `original_url_status`: "FICTIONAL_NO_URL"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H27", `type`: "ProcessingRecord", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/ProcessingRecord/H27", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `report_id`: "H27", `name`: "H27 processing", `processing_status`: "COMPLETE", `cap_omitted`: false, `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `output_path`: "$.reports[26]", `retained_idea_count`: 1}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H27.p1", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H27.p1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H27.p1", `name`: "H27.p1", `position`: 1, `text`: "NovaChips fait déjà tourner sa nouvelle ligne N8", `text_sha256`: "6ebb881357f6d5e8cc01a18ad2b683a8b8ac285cd335f6c7128c10daed5094f9", `input_path`: "$.reports[26].paragraphs[0]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H27.p2", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H27.p2", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H27.p2", `name`: "H27.p2", `position`: 2, `text`: "Le titre de la première édition était prématuré. NovaChips a annoncé aujourd’hui un projet de démarrage de sa ligne de puces d’IA N8 le 12 décembre 2026 ; la production n’a pas commencé. Notre version corrigée reprend le calendrier figurant dans le communiqué officiel mis en ligne ce matin. Ce document porte sur le lancement du projet et distingue les préparatifs de la fabrication elle-même. Les images de machines éclairées, utilisées en tête de page, datent de la présentation du site.", `text_sha256`: "6f1c1a7b8a8f6ff9bfa737320dbfd04c063616b94afb8f35d548c94506c4342e", `input_path`: "$.reports[26].paragraphs[1]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H27.p3", `type`: "Paragraph", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Paragraph/H27.p3", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `paragraph_id`: "H27.p3", `name`: "H27.p3", `position`: 3, `text`: "Le calendrier annoncé prévoit encore une période de réglage avant la date visée. La publication du plan permet aux clients de préparer leurs propres tests, mais elle ne constitue pas un compte rendu de sortie d’usine. Le communiqué porte la signature de l’entreprise et sa date de diffusion ; notre confirmation se limite à cette annonce et à ce qu’elle prévoit. Une livraison de puces produites sur la ligne N8 relèverait d’un événement ultérieur. La photographie de couverture reste accompagnée de sa légende originale pour éviter de lui donner la valeur d’un relevé de production.", `text_sha256`: "21d0b491ff4139e64bb594b695ca7403b93a6f9fc20dd2b40203eb07e984cf01", `input_path`: "$.reports[26].paragraphs[2]"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H27.1", `type`: "Expression", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Expression/H27.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H27.1", `report_id`: "H27", `position`: 1, `kind`: "CONFIRMED_NEWS", `event_phase`: "ANNOUNCEMENT", `output_path`: "$.reports[26].ideas[0]", `output_file`: "evidence/combined_output_A.json", `judgment_status`: "NO_RETAINED_UP_DOWN"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H27.1", `type`: "Idea", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Idea/H27.1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H27.1", `summary`: "NovaChips announced a plan to start its N8 AI-chip production line on 12 December 2026. Confirmation covers the announcement and planned date; production has not begun.", `identity_scope`: "REPORT_LOCAL_SINGLETON", `output_path`: "$.reports[26].ideas[0]", `domain_state`: "EXTRACTED"}},
{`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H27.1.e1", `type`: "Passage", `properties`: {`id`: "axhard-a-20261015/Passage/H27.1.e1", `fixture_id`: "axhard-a-20261015", `data_status`: "FICTIONAL", `name`: "H27.1 evidence 1", `quote`: "NovaChips a annoncé aujourd’hui un projet de démarrage de sa ligne de puces d’IA N8 le 12 décembre 2026 ; la production n’a pas commencé.", `paragraph_id`: "H27.p2", `position`: 1, `start_codepoint`: 49, `end_codepoint`: 186, `start_utf8_byte`: 54, `end_utf8_byte`: 201, `offset_convention`: "ZERO_BASED_END_EXCLUSIVE", `output_path`: "$.reports[26].ideas[0].evidence[0]"}},
